<title>USA: ASM Intl loses in patent ruling appeal.</title>
<headline>ASM Intl loses in patent ruling appeal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASM International N.V. said Tuesday a federal appeals court affirmed a lower court ruling that ASM's ribbed quartz reduced-pressure epitaxial reactors infringe two patents owned by Applied Materials Inc.</p>
<p>ASM said the decision will not affect any future ASM shipments of reduced-pressure reactors.</p>
</text>
